# Spring Boot 3.5.x reached OSS EOL at 3.5.16 (Spring Framework 6.2.19).
# The two CVEs below have no OSS patch in Spring Framework 6.2.x (fixed in 7.0.9+ / Spring Boot 4.x)
# and are not reachable in this application. Remove upon Spring Boot 4.1 migration.

# Spring MVC XsltView RCE/SSRF: no OSS patch in 6.2.x; not applicable (XsltView is unused).
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31

# Spring MVC/WebFlux SSE view-fragment stream corruption: no OSS patch in 6.2.x; not applicable
# (ValidationProgressTracker streams JSON DTO payloads over SseEmitter, not HTML view fragments / FragmentsRendering).
CVE-2026-47890 exp:2027-01-31
